pairRule559(SAURIAN_INTRO556,'Saurians are scaled and feathered humanoids descended from dinosaurs and pterosaurs. Their colors express emotions, and their clans honor ancestors and collectively care for hatchlings. They reach adulthood at age 7 and can live as long as gnomes.\n\nChoose one of four lineages. All are Medium Humanoids with a walking speed of 30 feet.\n\n2024 compatibility: ability increases continue to come from your background, without stacking another increase from this species. The original book allows +1 to two different scores or +2 to one score. The older variant grants Intelligence +1 and lineage increases: Sharpfang, Dexterity +2; Leatherwing, Intelligence +1 and Charisma +1; Hammer-tail, Constitution +1 and Wisdom +1; Webfoot, Strength +1 and Wisdom +1. These older increases are reference only and are not applied automatically.');
