pairRule559(DREAM_INTRO2014_557,'Dream Sorcery · D&D 2014 Sorcerer.\n\nDream magic brings visions from the sleeping mind into the waking world. You gain Dream Sorcery Spells and Fate of Dreams at Sorcerer level 1. Later benefits arrive at levels 6, 14, and 18, following Planegea. This option does not grant Innate Sorcery.');
